RREETTUURRNN VVAALLUUEE
       On success, wwoorrddeexxpp() returns 0.  On failure, wwoorrddeexxpp() returns one  of
       the following nonzero values:

       WWRRDDEE__BBAADDCCHHAARR
              Illegal  occurrence of newline or one of |, &, ;, <, >, (, ), {,
              }.

       WWRRDDEE__BBAADDVVAALL
              An undefined shell variable was referenced, and  the  WWRRDDEE__UUNNDDEEFF
              flag told us to consider this an error.

       WWRRDDEE__CCMMDDSSUUBB
              Command  substitution requested, but the WWRRDDEE__NNOOCCMMDD flag told us
              to consider this an error.

       WWRRDDEE__NNOOSSPPAACCEE
              Out of memory.

       WWRRDDEE__SSYYNNTTAAXX
              Shell syntax error, such as unbalanced parentheses or  unmatched
              quotes.

